<title>POLAND: BPH 96 NET RISES TO PLN 290.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH 96 NET RISES TO PLN 290.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 26.99 vs    11.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   35.21 vs    35.12</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 69.00 vs    66.45</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	97.17 vs   101.26</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					290.13 vs   244.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  443.28 vs   387.43</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		689.57 vs   568.30</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues   1,041.35 vs 1,030.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank</p>
<p>Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
